#lego-legacy-route 1
# LEGO Racers: unflagged cold boot -> SINGLE RACE -> Imperial Grand Prix ->
# Starting Grid -> 3-2-1-GO -> Turbo Start -> full 3D Lap 1 completion (harbor
# dock, Red Cannonball fire, Blue Shield activation, Power Slides, mine cave,
# waterfall bridge, pirate cannon tower) -> cross Finish Line into LAP 2 ->
# GAME PAUSED -> EXIT -> YES -> Main Menu -> clean exit (#373).
#
# Sequence:
# - Flips 0..247: plays unskippable lmicmp.avi, skips hvscmp.avi (Space) and
#   introcmp.avi (mouse click).
# - Flips 806..1111: Main Menu -> SINGLE RACE -> Imperial Grand Prix -> Joan of Kart.
# - Flips 1392..1745: Starting Grid + 3-2-1-GO countdown (60-flip 1.00 s cadence).
# - Flip 1745: Turbo Start on GO! (`Up down`).
# - Flips 1850..5926: full Lap 1 drive including Power Slides (`Space`), Red
#   Cannonball pickup & fire (`Return`, flip 2161), Blue Shield pickup &
#   activation (`Return`, flip 2608), White Power-Plus upgrade, and crossing
#   the Finish Line into LAP 2 (`BEST 1:10:41`, flip ~5997).
# - Flips 6072..6227: `Escape` -> `GAME PAUSED` -> `EXIT` -> `YES` -> Main Menu.
# - Flip 6370: closes cleanly (exit 0).
